FXD1_KRWTRI_raw — HUNT_FXDEPO iter6 NEAR-MISS CANDIDATE (6/7 charter gates; FAILS yearly-count gate).
Construction: 3-book DEX cross z-reversion. Spread_j = ln(P_A/P_B) for (DEXKOUS,DEXSDUS),
(DEXKOUS,DEXSFUS),(DEXKOUS,DEXNOUS) [USD-per-local H.10 noon rates; cross = quotient].
Per book: w = clip(-z_lb, ±2)/2 per LEG (z vs trailing mean/sd, lb = avg of 21d and 63d; cap=2).
Books averaged EW. T+1: PnL = pos.shift(1)*(r_A - r_B). Costs 6bps/side on |dpos|/2 per leg.
Borrow 0.5%/yr on short legs. Eval window 2008-01-02..2026-08-21, n=4666, no zero rows.
Instruments for trade-record audit: KRW NDF (offshore) vs SEK/NOK/CHF spot-or-forward legs
(cross executed as 2 USD legs). KRW NDF cost realism caveat: 6bps/side is optimistic (5-15bps
typical bid/ask) — see FINDINGS cost section.
GATES (2008+): SR 0.870 >=0.6 PASS | H1 1.075 / H2 0.606 >=0.3 PASS | neg years 8/19 FAIL
(>2; worst -3.09% 2018, all >-5%) | 200x 10d-block position-lag scramble p=0.000 (seeds 0,1,2)
PASS | ac1 -0.014 <0.5 PASS | uniqR 1.000 >=0.08 PASS | corr vs GOAL100_HONEST14V3_BALANCED
+0.005 (n=4665) PASS; corr vs CFX4 committed sleeve +0.1292 (n=1723) — below 0.15 but the two
share z-reversion family DNA; disclosed.
Stats: ann_geo 3.66% (arith 3.69%), vol 4.24%, MDD -10.2%, max|day| +5.05% (2008-10-30),
skew +2.61. Turnover 33.5%/day one-side; cost drag 5.07%/yr; borrow 0.53%/yr; gross exposure
mean 0.70x max 1.00x (no hidden leverage). 2008 crisis-weighted: 2008 +18.7%, 2009 +17.9%.
Robustness: cap plateau 0.861-0.871; lb plateau (10..63) 0.64-0.87; IS(08-15)-picked lb(10,21,42)
gives full-SR 0.869 (same verdict); OOS16+ 0.530, OOS17+ 0.624, OOS20+ 1.130, OOS23+ 1.202;
T+2 probe SR 0.019 (edge decays fast with lag — consistent with real short-horizon reversion);
zero-print-filtered 0.804; scrub-k 0.876/0.817/0.718/0.563 (k=5/10/20/50); LOYO min 0.706.
G10-only 6-book version (no KRW): SR -0.141 — the KRW leg is the edge carrier; pure-Scandi dead.
Verdict: REJECTED as a champion sleeve per charter (neg-year gate); delivered for chair review.
